    {
      "q": "Paneer जैसा लगेगा?",
      "a": "Texture is close to firm paneer, taste is milder — which is why the masala goes in as usual. Nine out of ten people in our test kitchen could not tell in a gravy; in a plain cube, they could."
    },
    {
      "q": "कितने दिन चलेगा?",
      "a": "5 days from the date of packing, refrigerated at 0–4 °C. Change the water daily and finish within 3 days of opening."
    },
    {
      "q": "Soy allergy?",
      "a": "Then this is not for you — it is soybean, water and coagulant, and we say so on the front of the pack. Nothing else is made in the kitchen."
    },
    {
      "q": "Freezer में रख सकते हैं?",
